      "writtenOn": "2024-05-06T10:07:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The release function documents this as `ASurfaceControl* _Nonnull* _Nonnull`. Shouldn\u0027t this be:\n\n```cpp\nASurfaceControl* _Nullable* _Nullable* _Nonnull outASurfaceControls\n```\n\nSaying that:\n1. The user must pass a valid pointer;\n2. in which we\u0027ll optionally_ return a pointer to a list of `ASurfaceControl`s (i.e. `NULL` if no surface controls were updated);\n3. If any `ASurfaceControl`s are returned (indicated by `outASurfaceControlsSize`), they are non-null.",
      "revId": "010b135cb4ebd95ac5c4f3563d5ffdd0ceaba353",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a5b600aa_83b239bb",
        "filename": "include/android/surface_control.h",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 225,
