      "writtenOn": "2024-05-07T23:52:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e outASurfaceControls\u0027s annotations should probably all be _Nonnull\n\nThat unfortunately doesn\u0027t work because clang doesn\u0027t know they are outputs, so if specified as _Nonnull they\u0027d be \"forced\" to be non-null when the function is called.\n\n\u003e Shouldn\u0027t this be: `ASurfaceControl* _Nullable* _Nullable* _Nonnull outASurfaceControls`\n\nIsn\u0027t that what it is in the current patch set?",
      "parentUuid": "2ab8f3f1_5e13a120",
      "revId": "010b135cb4ebd95ac5c4f3563d5ffdd0ceaba353",
