      "writtenOn": "2024-05-06T21:39:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks. Looking at how I originally implemented and documented these functions, it matches all that:\n\nhttps://github.com/rust-mobile/ndk/compare/master...surface-control#diff-967b72d1cb290ca6b626c9b8fd8f65902956105be0b5497e06c7784bfa58dd14\n\nI should add a note about not preserving submission ordering.\n\nMight be great to have the NDK documentation updated to reflect this kind of information (in a consistent, clear manner across all callbacks).",
      "parentUuid": "9d63ff57_2b23d416",
      "revId": "010b135cb4ebd95ac5c4f3563d5ffdd0ceaba353",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
